d-record-id-Nd39dUj6OoL6Tvxma5llhmb2gad\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Tr\u1ecdng t\u00e2m:<\/strong> T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a l\u01b0\u1ee3t chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u00ean trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WYc3djHGQorPo4xelxulajiKgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Live GMV Max:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JNYnd8RMTo3kCuxERlUlKBU6gi8\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u:<\/strong> C\u00e1c phi\u00ean livestream \u0111ang di\u1ec5n ra.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CVkJdtYnPoToKBxwPyWlj2wqguf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Lu\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh vi:<\/strong> Thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111ang l\u01b0\u1edbt TikTok, \u0111\u01b0a h\u1ecd tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0o <strong>ph\u00f2ng livestream<\/strong> c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S2uxd9LW0ohoN0xUeltliaghgMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Tr\u1ecdng t\u00e2m:<\/strong> T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem v\u00e0 doanh thu ngay trong phi\u00ean live.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MnwTd2JWsoV2MHxW7BQl41EEgCg\">C\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng v\u00e0 l\u1ee3i \u00edch n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Live GMV Max<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WZgZdA2j6okHW2x97CwlrP2Lgec\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u00f3a th\u00f4ng minh<\/strong>: H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\u00e2n t\u00edch v\u00e0 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng cao nh\u1ea5t s\u1ebd xem livestream v\u00e0 mua h\u00e0ng, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng s\u1ee9c nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UFCEdfIEcoN8X5xDTI1lacSKgGc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn<\/strong>: Ph\u00e1 v\u1ee1 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n c\u1ee7a t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i c\u00f3 s\u1eb5n, \u0111\u01b0a phi\u00ean livestream c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi, gi\u00fap t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dw0edsgdRoQrPrxGL92l7qtggw0\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110a d\u1ea1ng h\u00f3a m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong>: Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o vi\u1ec7c &#8220;ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n&#8221;, Live GMV Max c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u cho c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau kh\u00e1c nh\u01b0 t\u0103ng s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c (b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, th\u1ea3 tim) trong livestream.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WH3tduVT2oxWOKxR2J6lxP0zgHe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c<\/strong>: M\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng \u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec3m l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd li\u00ean t\u1ee5c ph\u00e2n t\u00edch v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh vi\u1ec7c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ngay trong khi b\u1ea1n \u0111ang livestream \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chi ti\u00eau v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 nh\u1ea5t, mang l\u1ea1i k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-K8awdygIgoOQWoxaEuqlyNxRglc\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch Live GMV Max<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C85edrTuho6bB8xgHAylOrFcgl6\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi ch\u1ea1y<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S2sXdH6OgoPuNQxd2m5l7YtkgPd\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o t\u1ed1t kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 c\u1ee9u v\u00e3n m\u1ed9t phi\u00ean live s\u01a1 s\u00e0i. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OT9TdTRBBohEKux59Hul6O7lgBG\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00f3 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Shop<\/strong> v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghim trong gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng live.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H9Fzdzwy5omP6Cxet09l9klzgle\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>L\u00ean k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n livestream h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn<\/strong>: X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh r\u00f5 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee7 l\u1ef1c, c\u00e1c deal \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n, mini-game t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 th\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cho t\u1eebng ph\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IJGOdFMnKongT1xUOC3lxyuIgOh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt<\/strong>: Ki\u1ec3m tra \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng truy\u1ec1n internet \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng, camera s\u1eafc n\u00e9t v\u00e0 \u00e2m thanh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S5i3d4ixpoSTsMxl46rlHr8ggLb\">\u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy\u1ec1n ph\u00e1t cao nh\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u0