-NqxudtCBDoQav8xCFQblcKpzgNd\">C\u00e1ch ch\u1ea1y LIVE GMV Max (T\u1ed1i \u01b0u GMV cho Livestream) qua Tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o &#8211; Ads Manager<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EOtxdDKnqoblHnxt4bHlB017gMh\">C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o LIVE GMV Max th\u00f4ng qua Trung t\u00e2m qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng (Seller Center) c\u0169ng gi\u1ed1ng v\u1edbi c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Product GMV Max (T\u1ed1i \u01b0u GMV cho S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m) \u1edf tr\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EeiGdv4f1oGUpCxDX9dlIM4sgfg\">C\u00f3 m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat thay \u0111\u1ed5i \u1edf ph\u1ea7n ch\u1ecdn \u1edf <strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2<\/strong>, thay v\u00ec ch\u1ecdn &#8220;Promote Products&#8221; th\u00ec s\u1ebd ch\u1ecdn <strong>&#8220;Promote LIVE&#8221;<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-HyBddZtRJoZOC4xE8MhllcnZgpg\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;cd7cf159-be21-4431-aaf9-d304d9a24330&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNkNXbIZg8ofKQXxBAUblEiccg1e%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NkNXbIZg8ofKQXxBAUblEiccg1e&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:158447,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlaVdiwjloo1KxxFSDylMgbJgCe\">\u1ede ph\u1ea7n n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o nh\u1eb1m t\u1ed1i \u0111a h\u00f3a doanh thu \u0