ng=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5257\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e1db2a16-ac68-47fd-806a-0ac42406c10d.png\" alt=\"Nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng (Targeting), Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch, l\u1ecbch ch\u1ea1y v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e1db2a16-ac68-47fd-806a-0ac42406c10d.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e1db2a16-ac68-47fd-806a-0ac42406c10d-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e1db2a16-ac68-47fd-806a-0ac42406c10d-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e1db2a16-ac68-47fd-806a-0ac42406c10d-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e1db2a16-ac68-47fd-806a-0ac42406c10d-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5257\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng (Targeting), Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch, l\u1ecbch ch\u1ea1y v\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GjVIdxqaXoA9d6x9Bz0l3Heggne\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1eafm m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng (Targeting): Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o LIVE ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Odlqd0ybSoZ4h5xYXWdlXmAUgfc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch &amp; L\u1ecbch ch\u1ea1y: \u0110\u1eb7t ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch tr\u1ecdn \u0111\u1eddi.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRS5dHFzOosGlOxi7x5lGHU2g94\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1eb7t gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u &amp; T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BcYkdyMheoYBOixv27blf16kgKf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00e1 th\u1ea7u: Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee9c LIVE ROI m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau mong mu\u1ed1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OnLCdChleop8GnxnIHplvyBpg2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a: H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1eb7t l\u00e0 &#8220;Doanh thu g\u1ed9p t\u1ed1i \u0111a tr\u00ean phi\u00ean live&#8221; (Maximize Gross Revenue).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LXbkd9raEoq48gxhD1xljT9hgAd\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5 : Ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Rz4Ad1GaponGRDx9K5elPvdVgUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>N\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o: B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00eam m\u1ed9t video gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u ng\u1eafn (Intro Video) \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi h\u1ecd v\u00e0o phi\u00ean live ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c. N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh livestream c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AREbdUmQqoIEQXxds9wlWQ5bgKg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>V\u0103n b\u1ea3n: Vi\u1ebft m\u1ed9t d\u00f2ng ti\u00eau \u0111\u1ec1 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ec3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o xem LIVE.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O7s7df4gZobtfVx8PjOlR8Jggoe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1ea5n &#8220;G\u1eedi&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t v\u00e0 ch\u1edd x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CfAAdbP7DoiA6rxtNHxlrtBJgih\">B\u00ed quy\u1ebft t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 Live GMV Max<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QrRCdxiHeoCecLxTIdolu7Cngve\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>N\u1ed9i dung l\u00e0 vua:<\/strong> M\u1ed9t k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n livestream cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat, n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao s\u1ebd gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem l\u00e2u h\u01a1n, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n cho qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQrOdpz0aoWCGLxuhWpl0PSGgcJ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 gi\u00e1:<\/strong> T\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee7 l\u1ef1c v\u00e0 tung ra nh\u1eefng &#8220;deal h\u1eddi&#8221; \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 trong livestream \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 c\u1ea5p b\u00e1ch, k\u00edch th\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua ngay.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F6oldQA6loCjZcxfgcBlKvIJgrd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3:<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng c\u1ee7a TikTok Live nh\u01b0 t\u1ea1o mini-game, ghim voucher, m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 l\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4QwdsSdUoDbRTxeMSylUglxgvh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi KOL\/KOC:<\/strong> M\u1eddi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 s\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng tham gia livestream c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCMgdqCZnofL0CxeuU1l7z21gWh\">Nh\u01b0 v\u1eady, th\u00f4ng qua b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 hi\u1ec3u th\u00eam v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Live GMV Max tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E1QndZT37oKD1Cx1TxulzzUigaf\">H\u00e3y ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c theo d\u00f5i trang blog c\u1ee7a <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u00eam nh\u1eefng m\u1eb9o hay \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n shop b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 tr\u00ean TikTok m\u00e0 c\u00f2n tr\u00ean c\u00e1c trang TM\u0110T kh\u00e1c th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c k\u00eanh th\u00f4ng tin d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QRGudZsZEo9ZhdxaGDylKswMgXx\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F8AwdjbNro043KxYg9plRuNKgnh\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0OtdKCcvoOUW3xtdZZlIEDkgmb\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YKvwdClADo8NWAx9byZlvpl9gWb\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLbkdYNAUoQV06xF1EalfSeWghc\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DRnGdVxVaoSkTMxgYtClN21GgGb\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/le